  "application_conditions": [
    "SiC MOSFETs and IGBTs up to the device's isolation and working-voltage ratings; used with 700-800 V discrete SiC (TIDA-010054) and 1700 V module drivers (CGD1700HB2M-UNA).",
    "Requires an isolated secondary supply (VDD-VEE up to 33 V) and a 3.3 V/5 V primary supply."
  ],
  "design_considerations": [
    "Split OUTH/OUTL allow independent turn-on and turn-off resistors without steering diodes.",
    "The OC pin supports DESAT with external HV diode(s) or shunt sensing; trip voltage and blanking are set externally (see CB-GD-001).",
    "Wire IN+/IN- of the HS and LS drivers to each other's PWM for hardware interlock; it is not a dead-time generator (PRD-09301 §5.6).",
    "The analog-to-PWM channel is referenced to the driver's isolated side; prefer the low-side driver for temperature sensing (PRD-09301 §3.4)."
  ],
